sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as User / Perses / Gateway
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant Gate as method-gate<br/>127.0.0.1:9092 HTTP
    participant PLP as prom-label-proxy<br/>127.0.0.1:9091 HTTP
    participant Thanos as Thanos Querier<br/>10902/TCP HTTP
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Op as odh-observability operator
    participant WH as Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Coll as OTel Collector<br/>4317/4318 TLS
    participant TA as TargetAllocator<br/>HTTPS mTLS
    participant Tempo as Tempo<br/>OTLP gRPC TLS
    participant Loki as LokiStack gateway<br/>HTTPS
    participant Obj as S3 / GCS<br/>443/TCP

    Note over Client,Thanos: Flow 1 - Namespace-scoped metrics query
    Client->>Router: GET /api/v1/query?namespace=ns1<br/>Bearer token
    Router->>KRP: Reencrypt TLS (service CA)
    KRP->>API: TokenReview + SAR get metrics.k8s.io/pods in ns1
    API-->>KRP: Allowed
    KRP->>Gate: HTTP loopback
    Gate->>Gate: Allow GET/HEAD (Thanos: read-only form POST)<br/>reject body namespace field
    Gate->>PLP: HTTP loopback
    PLP->>Thanos: PromQL with namespace="ns1" matcher<br/>HTTP plaintext
    Thanos-->>PLP: Result
    PLP-->>Client: JSON response (via chain)

    Note over API,TA: Flow 2 - Metric collection
    API->>WH: AdmissionReview PodMonitor/ServiceMonitor<br/>TLS (cert-manager CA)
    WH-->>API: JSON patch add scrape=true label
    Coll->>TA: Fetch scrape targets<br/>mTLS client cert
    Coll->>Coll: Scrape workload targets (per monitor, DCGM :9400 HTTP)
    Note right of Coll: MonitoringStack Prometheus scrapes<br/>collector exporter :8889 HTTPS

    Note over Coll,Obj: Flow 3 - Tracing
    Coll->>Tempo: otlp/tempo export<br/>TLS service CA, SA token (write ACL)
    Tempo->>Obj: Store traces<br/>HTTPS, storage secret

    Note over Coll,Loki: Flow 4 - MaaS usage logs
    Coll->>Loki: otlphttp/loki<br/>TLS service-ca, SA token
    Note right of Coll: Optional remote exporters use<br/>TLS + credentialSecret token

    Note over API,Op: Flow 5 - Reconciliation
    Op->>API: Watch Monitoring, CRDs, OperatorConditions<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
    Op->>API: Server-Side Apply operand CRs, RBAC,<br/>NetworkPolicies, Routes
    Op->>API: Label GC (part-of=monitoring)
